{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a rogue-like &amp; bullet-heaven mix; survive by raising hordes of skeletons to fight alongside you against the many foes of ancient Egypt and Greece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the name of Serapis, the ancient Graeco-Egyptian God of life and death, you rebuild a lost religion, raise legendary heroes, find mighty relics, and raise powerful armies of the dead.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573390/extras/RaiseGif.gif?t=1744101192\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How long will you stay alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different summonable servants &amp; strategies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hordes</strong> of enemies to run over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ strategy-defining Relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prologue &amp; one playable Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of bones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573390/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744101192\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCORD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019d like to stay up to date, be sure to join us on discord for the most recent updates, and options to give feedback! We want to involve <strong>YOU</strong> in the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPDATES &amp; FUTURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is still in development. There will be many changes and improvements. Many inspired by play-testers and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/35